162 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 106 0 R
/E (The Mount Zion Baptist Church brand is a visual expression and reflection of the church it represents. It is the identity, perception, and expectation of our church in the minds of the people within the Griffin community.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
163 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 106 0 R
/E (To be effective, our brand must be distinctive, memorable, and consistent. This brand is more than just a logo; it encompasses our specific color palette, typography, user interface design, and photography style. The Mount Zion brand is brought to life through our foundational visual guidelines and our digital presence on the web.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
164 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 106 0 R
/E (These guidelines are intended to serve as a starting point and framework for the development of our brand identity and website implementation, rather than a rigid set of solutions for every possibility. This system allows for creativity and flexibility, but care should always be taken to maintain the consistency and continuity that honors our mission online.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
